    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TechnoRunner</strong> is an indie Arcade game, mixing Rythm game and Endless Runner, set in procedurally generated levels. Compete on a global leaderboard or against your friends for the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The music sets the pace! Move in the rythm, and take as many risks as possible to unlock combo chains. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The walls are procedurally generated, increasing difficulty with time. Can you reach the end of a song?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game was carefully crafted by a solo indie developer. And he hopes you like it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also available for FREE on Android : search &quot;TechnoRunner&quot; on Google Play Store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made in Unreal Engine 5</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TechnoRunner</strong> is an indie Arcade game, mixing Rythm game and Endless Runner, set in procedurally generated levels. Compete on a global leaderboard or against your friends for the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The music sets the pace! Move in the rythm, and take as many risks as possible to unlock combo chains. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The walls are procedurally generated, increasing difficulty with time. Can you reach the end of a song?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game was carefully crafted by a solo indie developer. And he hopes you like it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also available for FREE on Android : search &quot;TechnoRunner&quot; on Google Play Store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made in Unreal Engine 5</p>",
    "short_description": "An indie Arcade Game mixing Rythm Game and Endless Runner, based on techno music with procedural generation. How fast can you go? How high can you score? Find out now!",
